+# Slice 3.S — settings, web build 1: light palette, keys into the editor, settings data and store
+
+Board "Settings" row 3. Product rule: `docs/plan.md` §2 **#57** (read it whole; every sentence is
+acceptance, except the settings view's look, which is the next build's). Design:
+`docs/slices/briefs/3.S-settings-design.md` option C; this brief carries what you need from it.
+The desktop build (row 2) is merged: crate `yamt-settings`, four commands, `IpcError` variants and
+the generated `frontend/src/ipc/bindings.ts` are in the tree — read them there. Where this brief
+and #57 disagree, #57 wins; report it.
+
+## Target
+
+Owned:
+
+- `frontend/index.html`, `frontend/src/style.css`, `frontend/src/main.ts`;
+- `frontend/scripts/palette.ts`, `frontend/scripts/palette.test.ts`;
+- `frontend/src/ipc/**` except `bindings.ts` (generated, hook-blocked);
+- `frontend/src/editor/**`;
+- `frontend/src/ui/**` except `SettingsView.vue` and `MergeToolbar.vue` (the next build's; it also
+  creates `KeymapList.vue` and `KeyRecorder.vue` — do not create them).
+
+Read-only: everything else (`crates/**`, `src-tauri/**`, `docs/**`, `.omp/**`). The orchestrator
+updates `docs/architecture.md` and the project map from your report: list every new, removed or
+renamed file and every public-surface change in `deviations_from_brief`.
+
+Non-goals: the settings view's content (theme buttons, key list, key dialog, location field —
+next build); hiding Undo/Redo (next build); the middle pane's text-editing keys; mouse gestures;
+following the system theme.
+
+## Contract
+
+Fixed (exists; add only): `MergeController`'s current public members, `MergeHosts`,
+`MergeHandle`'s current members, the store's current state and actions, `ChunkSource`'s current
+methods, the generated bindings.
+
+New public surface (exactly this; names fixed because the next build codes against them):
+
+```ts
+// ipc/index.ts re-exports (domain types; `Theme`, `StoredSettings`, `KeysChange` as generated)
+export type SettingsRead = { readonly path: string; readonly defaultPath: string; readonly stored: StoredSettings };
+
+// ipc/keys.ts — the one source for what keys mean (vision 2)
+export type KeyAction =
+  | "apply" | "ignore" | "next-change" | "previous-change" | "left-side" | "right-side"
+  | "undo" | "redo" | "find" | "find-next" | "find-previous" | "close-find" | "indent" | "outdent";
+export const KEY_ACTIONS: readonly KeyAction[];            // the list order above
+export type KeyName = string & { readonly __brand: "KeyName" };  // a named key or one character
+export type Key = {
+  readonly mod: boolean;      // Ctrl on Linux, ⌘ on macOS
+  readonly macCtrl: boolean;  // ⌃ on macOS; such a key never fires on Linux (#665)
+  readonly alt: boolean;
+  readonly shift: boolean;
+  readonly name: KeyName;
+};
+export type KeyBindings = Readonly<Record<KeyAction, readonly Key[]>>;
+export const DEFAULT_KEYS: KeyBindings;
+export function parseKey(text: string): Key | null;
+export function keyText(key: Key): string;                 // the file form
+export function keyLabel(key: Key, platform: string): string;
+export function keyOfEvent(
+  event: Pick<KeyboardEvent, "key" | "code" | "ctrlKey" | "metaKey" | "altKey" | "shiftKey">,
+  platform: string,
+): Key | null;
+export function sameKey(a: Key, b: Key): boolean;
+export type KeyProblem =
+  | { readonly kind: "unreadable"; readonly action: KeyAction; readonly text: string }
+  | { readonly kind: "twice"; readonly key: Key; readonly actions: readonly [KeyAction, KeyAction] };
+export type KeysRead = { readonly bindings: KeyBindings; readonly problems: readonly KeyProblem[] };
+export function bindingsOf(stored: StoredSettings["keys"]): KeysRead;
+
+// ipc/ChunkSource.ts gains
+loadSettings(current: StoredSettings): Promise<SourceResult<SettingsRead>>;
+setTheme(current: StoredSettings, theme: Theme): Promise<SourceResult<SettingsRead>>;
+setKeys(current: StoredSettings, changes: readonly KeysChange[]): Promise<SourceResult<SettingsRead>>;
+moveSettings(current: StoredSettings, path: string): Promise<SourceResult<SettingsRead>>;
+
+// editor/index.ts
+export type Preferences = { readonly theme: Theme; readonly keys: KeyBindings };
+export type MergeOptions = { readonly readOnly: boolean; readonly preferences: Preferences }; // preferences required
+// MergeController gains: setPreferences(preferences: Preferences): void
+// MergeController.historyKey(event) matches preferences.keys.undo / redo
+
+// ui/useMergeController.ts: useMergeController(data, hosts, readOnly, preferences: MaybeRefOrGetter<Preferences>)
+//   — every opened file, shown or hidden, follows a change at once
+
+// ui/keyText.ts (words): ACTION_NAMES: Record<KeyAction, string> ("Apply", "Ignore",
+//   "Next change", "Previous change", "Left side", "Right side", "Undo", "Redo", "Find",
+//   "Find next", "Find previous", "Close find", "Indent", "Outdent"), ACTION_PLACES (where each
+//   acts, one short phrase), KEYMAP_GROUPS: readonly { title: string; actions: readonly KeyAction[] }[]
+//   = "Side panes" (apply … right-side), "Anywhere in the file" (undo, redo), "Find" (four),
+//   "Result pane" (indent, outdent)
+
+// ui/store.ts (useAppStore) gains
+settings: Readonly<ShallowRef<SettingsInUse>>;  // { read: SettingsRead | null; theme: Theme; keys: KeysRead }
+preferences: ComputedRef<Preferences>;
+loadSettings(): Promise<void>;
+setTheme(theme: Theme): Promise<void>;
+addKey(action: KeyAction, key: Key): Promise<void>;
+changeKey(action: KeyAction, from: Key, to: Key): Promise<void>;
+removeKey(action: KeyAction, key: Key): Promise<void>;
+removeAllKeys(action: KeyAction): Promise<void>;
+resetKeys(action: KeyAction): Promise<void>;
+moveSettings(path: string): Promise<void>;
+// createAppStore(source, startTheme: Theme)
+```
+
+## Behaviour
+
+### Theme
+
+1. **Palette.** `style.css` keeps the dark `@theme static` block as it is and gains one
+   `:root[data-theme="light"]` block redefining **every** colour token with these values
+   (Islands Light, read by the design from `ManyIslandsLight.theme.json`, `expUI_lightScheme.xml`
+   and its parent "Default" in `DefaultColorSchemesManager.xml`; files under
+   `/tmp/yamt-islands-light/themes/`, re-extract from
+   `~/.local/share/JetBrains/WebStorm-262.10968.77/lib/intellij.platform.ide.impl.jar` if gone):
+
+   | token          | light     |     | token                  | light             |
+   | -------------- | --------- | --- | ---------------------- | ----------------- |
+   | window         | #e9eaee   |     | primary                | #3871e1           |
