+  cases from item 9; `bindingsOf` cases from item 10); `ui/keymapEdit.test.ts` (item 14's rules);
+  `editor/internal/keys.test.ts` (`cmKey`: Shift+x → "X", Mod-Shift-z, Space, macCtrl on Linux →
+  none); `pane.test.ts` (Indent on Mod-i beats selectParentSyntax; Undo bound to Alt-Backspace →
+  Mod-z does nothing in the middle and Mod-u still undoes the selection; Tab unbound → no indent);
+  `sideFocus` (Apply rebound to "a" → "a" applies, Enter does not); `historyKey` (rebound Undo
+  works window-wide; the non-Latin fallback stays); `fixtureSettings.test.ts`; `palette.test.ts`;
+  store tests (load on focus applies a changed file; a failure keeps the settings in use; a clash
+  asks and Move writes both changes in one call; Cancel writes nothing).
+- **Real app on a private X display** (`Xvfb`, `tauri-driver`, `GDK_BACKEND=x11`,
+  `XDG_CONFIG_HOME=/tmp/<dir>/config` — never the owner's `~/.config`; a repo from
+  `scripts/conflict-repo.sh`; a debug build of your tree). There is no settings view yet: drive
+  settings by writing the file by hand. Real pointer and key input at visible elements (WebDriver
+  actions or `xdotool`); read state with `execute` only. Paste what you observe:
+  1. File `{"theme": "light"}` before start: the window opens light (page screenshot: panels,
+     syntax, change colours, connectors); first frames show no dark frame (frame capture).
+  2. Open two files. Edit the file to `{"theme": "dark", "keys": {"apply": ["a"]}}` while another
+     X window has focus, then focus yamt: both files are dark; in the hidden file too (switch to
+     it); "a" on a focused side change applies it, Enter does not.
+  3. `"undo": ["Alt-Backspace"]`: Ctrl+Z in the middle no longer undoes; Alt+Backspace does, from
